<section id="request" class="request"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">PICKUP SERVICE · ITEM COLLECTION</div><h2>क्या लेना है?<br>Pickup कहाँ चाहिए?</h2></div><p class="muted">एक request में कई items जोड़ें। यह form सीधे SQLite database में save होगा और admin dashboard में दिखाई देगा.</p></div><div class="form-layout"><div class="panel"><form id="pickupForm"><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label>Name *</label><input name="name" required placeholder="आपका नाम"></div><div class="field"><label>Phone *</label><input name="phone" required type="tel" placeholder="10 digit mobile"></div><div class="field"><label>Area</label><input name="area" placeholder="Andheri, Borivali, Kurla..."></div><div class="field"><label>Pickup date</label><input name="pickup_date" type="date"></div><div class="field"><label>Pickup time</label><input name="pickup_time" type="time"></div><div class="field"><label>Address *</label><input name="address" required placeholder="Full pickup address"></div></div><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:24px 0"><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label>Item</label><select id="cat"><option>Saree</option><option>Pants / Shirts / T-shirt</option><option>Kurti / Dress</option><option>Old Mobile</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Quantity</label><input id="qty" type="number" min="1" value="1"></div><div class="field full"><label>Item note</label><input id="itemnote" placeholder="Example: 8 sarees, mixed condition"></div></div><button type="button" class="btn dark" id="addItem" style="margin-top:15px">+ Add item</button><div class="items" id="items"><div class="notice">No items added yet.</div></div><div class="field"><label>Additional note</label><textarea name="notes" placeholder="Anything the pickup team should know?"></textarea></div><p class="notice">By submitting, you are sending the pickup enquiry to this website's SQLite database for admin follow-up.</p><button class="btn dark" type="submit">Submit pickup request ↗</button><div class="success" id="success"></div></form></div><aside class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h3 style="font-size:30px;line-height:1">Simple collection request.</h3><p class="muted">1. Add your items.<br>2. Send pickup details.<br>3. Admin sees the request instantly in the dashboard.<br>4. Status can be changed to contacted, scheduled or picked up.</p><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85" alt="Clothing sorting" style="width:100%;height:300px;object-fit:cover;margin-top:20px"></aside></div></div></section>
